@rioplatense **Dialect Calibration (Rioplatense):** Rioplatense: Sequence warmth and sobremesa rapport before systemic reframes; cushion game exits with clear relational care so steadiness never reads as coldness.
@espana **Dialect Calibration (España):** España: Crisp, direct framing works well among peers; respect presence-first regularity in community/personal circles and avoid heavy clinical jargon.
